<title>MOROCCO: TENNIS-MOROCCO'S ARAZI WINS HASSAN II GRAND PRIX.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MOROCCO'S ARAZI WINS HASSAN II GRAND PRIX.</headline>
<dateline>CASABLANCA, Morocco 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the Hassan II Grand Prix tennis final on Sunday: Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Franco Squillari (Argentina) 3-6 6-1 6-2.</p>
</text>
